{
  "scenario_brief": "Ops demo: the Terminal close up. Fenlow Managed IT's field engineer Zainab is setting up remote support for Merrin & Sallow's file server, and Ama Owusu asks you to look at it the way an attacker's tools would. Read a scanner's report and a console's search in the Terminal view, test which findings are real, then see what a timed sign-in token and a shared screen give you, and what they do not. Authorised practice in a fictional office; nothing to break and no combat.",
  "endGoal": "Demo only: read the Terminal's reports, test the findings, and see what a token, a shared screen and a keyboard-only device do over a remote session.",
